      "body": "I am not sure that this is the correct fix. It will cause an unnecessary overallocation in normal case.\n\nRewinding the position is already problematic, we were going to disable it, as it can lead to infinite loop. But at least there should be guard preventing crash. Something wrong with these guards. Or they were not added yet? I need to look at past issues.",
